# FlameLang Example: Sequential computation
# Demonstrates multiple operations in sequence
# Note: In v1.0, only the last operation's result is returned

# Step 1: Add base numbers (result: 8)
add 3 5

# Step 2: Multiply (result: 16)
mul 8 2

# Step 3: Subtract adjustment (result: 12)
# This is the final result that will be returned
sub 16 4
